#. type: Title ==
#: ../src/factory-gauge.adoc:286 ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "Redstone"
msgstr "红石"

#. type: Title =
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Arithmetic Tube"
msgstr "算术管"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Arithmetic tube is an item added by this mod. It can be placed in factory "
"controllers to to perform arithmetic operations, such as addition, "
"multiplication, division, rounding and trigonometry."
msgstr "算术管是此模组所添加的物品。它可以被放置于工厂控制器中用于数字运算，例如加法、乘法、除法、四舍五入和三角运算。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Arithmetic tubes primarily connect with other components via number "
"connections. They may be used to obtain information from or control "
"components such as xref:factory-gauge.adoc#number-connection[factory gauges] "
"and xref:redstone-link.adoc#signal-strength[redstone links]."
msgstr "算术管通常主要数字连接来连接至与其他组件。它们可用于从xref:factory-gauge.adoc#number-connection[工厂仪表]和xref:redstone-link.adoc#signal-strength[无线红石信号终端]之类的组件获取信息或控制它们。"

#. type: Block title
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Arithmetic tubes with various operators"
msgstr "具有各种运算符的算术管"

#. type: Block title
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "An arithmetic tube calculating the ratio between iron and gold ingots monitored by factory gauges"
msgstr "正在计算由工厂仪表检测的铁锭和金锭数量的比例的算术管"

#. type: Title ==
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Obtaining"
msgstr "获取"

#. type: Block title
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recipe tree of arithmetic tubes (by EMI)"
msgstr "算术管的配方树（出自 EMI）"

#. type: #obtaining
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Cut an amethyst shard into 2 cut amethyst with a stonecutter or mechanical "
"saw."
msgstr "使用切石机或动力锯，将一块紫水晶碎片切割成两块切制紫水晶。"

#. type: #obtaining
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Each cut amethyst can be crafted with an iron plate into an arithmetic tube."
msgstr "每块切制紫水晶都可以与铁板合成，制成一个算术管。"

#. type: Title ==
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:24 ../src/redstone-link.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Operating Principle"
msgstr "工作原理"

#. type: #principle
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:27
msgid ""
"An arithmetic tube can perform various calculations depending on its "
"selected operator. Arithmetic operators can be categorized by the number of "
"inputs they accept, referred to as the [#term-arity]_arity_."
msgstr "根据其选择的运算符，算术管可以进行各种计算。运算符可以按照其接受的输入的数量（称为[#term-arity]__元数__）来分类。"

#. type: Block title
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Arithmetic operators categorized by arity"
msgstr "按元数分类的运算符"

