msgstr "`tan` +\n  正切"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:78
msgid ""
"Each input corresponds to an incoming number connection, or a <<constant-"
"input,constant>>. The result is propogated to the output after 1 tick."
msgstr "每个输入对应一个传入的数字连接，或者一个<<constant-input,常量>>。结果在 1 游戏刻后输出。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:80
msgid ""
"Numbers are 64-bit floating point values. They can represent fractional "
"values, but their precision is limited. Slight rounding may occur during "
"calculation. Integers outside the range ±2^53^ may not be exact. Dividing a "
"non-zero number by 0 results in ∞ or -∞."
msgstr "数字为 64 位浮点数。它们可以表示小数，但精度有限，计算过程中可能会出现轻微的舍入误差。超出 ±2^53^ 范围的整数可能不精确；非零数除以 0 的结果为 ∞ 或 -∞ 。"

#. type: Title ==
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "Basic Configuration"
msgstr "基础配置"

#. type: Block title
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "Arithmetic tube settings"
msgstr "算术管设置"

#. type: #figure-arithmetic-tube-settings
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:90
msgid ""
"❶ Operator selection menu:: Click to open a menu to select an arithmetic "
"operator."
msgstr "❶ 运算符选择菜单:: 点击以打开菜单，选择运算符。"

#. type: #figure-arithmetic-tube-settings
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:93
msgid "❷❸❹ Input entry:: Shown for each input of this arithmetic tube."
msgstr "❷❸❹ 输入项:: 显示此算术管的每个输入。"

#. type: #figure-arithmetic-tube-settings
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:96
msgid ""
"❷ Input source icon:: Shows the source of this input, such as the component "
"at the other end of the number connection."
msgstr "❷ 输入源图标:: 显示此输入的来源，例如数字连接另一端的组件。"

#. type: #figure-arithmetic-tube-settings
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:99
msgid "❸ Input value:: Shows the value of this input."
msgstr "❸ 输入值:: 显示此输入的值。"

#. type: #figure-arithmetic-tube-settings
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:102
msgid "❹ Remove input button:: Click to remove this input."
msgstr "❹ 移除输入按钮:: 点击移除此输入。"

#. type: #figure-arithmetic-tube-settings
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:105
msgid "❺ Result:: Shows the result of calculation."
msgstr "❺ 结果:: 显示计算结果。"

#. type: #figure-arithmetic-tube-settings
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:108
msgid ""
"❻ Relocate button:: Click to move the location of this tube on the virtual "
"board."
msgstr "❻ 移动组件按钮:: 点击以在虚拟面板上移动该算术管。"

#. type: #figure-arithmetic-tube-settings
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:111
msgid ""
"❼ Add connection button:: Click to connect another component as an input, or "
"to a <<redstone,redstone signal>>."
msgstr "❼ 添加连接按钮:: 点击以连接至其它组件做为输入，或连接至<<redstone,红石信号>>。"

#. type: #figure-arithmetic-tube-settings
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:114
msgid "❽ Add constant button:: Click to add a <<constant-input,constant>>."
msgstr "❽ 添加常量按钮:: 点击以添加<<constant-input,常量>>。"

#. type: #figure-arithmetic-tube-settings
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:117
msgid "❾ Confirm button:: Click to confirm settings and close this screen."
msgstr "❼ 确认按钮:: 点击以保存设置并关闭界面。"

#. type: #figure-arithmetic-tube-settings
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:119
msgid ""
"For binary operators, the 2 inputs are distinguished as primary (blue) and "
"secondary (red) input. Their roles in relation to the operator is typically "
"displayed in ❶. They may be swapped by clicking ❿."
msgstr "对于二元运算符，其两个输入被区分为主输入（蓝色）和副输入（红色），它们与运算符的关系通常会在 ❶ 中显示。点击 ❿ 可以交换它们。"

#. type: Block title
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:120
#, no-wrap
msgid "Arithmetic tube settings with a binary operator"
msgstr "使用二元运算符的算术管的设置"

#. type: #figure-arithmetic-tube-settings
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:124
msgid ""
"Switching between operators with different <<term-arity,arities>> is "
"sometimes disallowed. In that case, remove inputs so that the number of "
"inputs aligns with the new operator."
msgstr "不同<<term-arity,元数>>的运算符之间有时无法切换，此时请移除一些输入，使输入个数符合新的运算符。"

#. type: Title ==
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:126
#, no-wrap
msgid "Constant"
msgstr "常量"

#. type: #constant-input
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:129
msgid ""
"Clicking <<figure-arithmetic-tube-settings>> ❽ creates an editable constant "
"as an input. On a constant input, click ❸ and type to set the constant to "
"arbitrary values. You may enter any number in decimal, or computerized "
"scientific notation (e.g. 1e2 for 100)."
msgstr "点击<<figure-arithmetic-tube-settings>> ❽ 会创建一个可编辑的常量作为输入。在常量输入中，点击 ❸ 后可键入任意值。你可以使用十进制数字，也可使用计算机化科学计数法（例如用 1e2 表示 100）。"

#. type: Block title
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:130
#, no-wrap
msgid "Settings with a constant"
msgstr "带有常量的设置"

#. type: Block title
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:133
#, no-wrap
msgid "Editing a constant"
msgstr "编辑常量"

#. type: #constant-input
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:137
msgid ""
"Additionally, the special constants π, τ, e, ∞ and -∞ can be entered via the "
"⏷ dropdown menu, or typed in their literal or English form."
msgstr "此外，通过 ⏷ 下拉菜单可以输入特殊常数 π、τ、e、∞ 和 -∞ ，它们也可以作为字符或以英文形式键入。"

#. type: #redstone
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:142
msgid ""
"An arithmetic tube can also be connected to other components via redstone "
"connections, such as with xref:electron-tube.adoc[logical tubes] and "
"xref:redstone-link.adoc[redstone links]."
msgstr "算术管也可以通过红石连接连接至其他组件，例如xref:electron-tube.adoc[逻辑管]和xref:redstone-link.adoc[无线红石信号终端]。"

#. type: Title ===
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:144
#, no-wrap
msgid "Redstone Input"
msgstr "红石输入"

#. type: #redstone-input
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:147
msgid ""
"When connected by redstone as a sink, the behaviour of the arithmetic tube "
"when powered by redstone can be configured."
msgstr "做为红石连接的目标时，此算术管被红石充能时的行为可以被修改。"

#. type: Block title
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:148
#, no-wrap
msgid "Settings with an incoming redstone connection"
msgstr "具有红石输入连接的设置"

#. type: #redstone-input
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:152
msgid "2 options can be selected by scrolling on ❶:"
msgstr "在 ❶ 上滚动可以选择 2 个选项之一："

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:153
#, no-wrap
msgid "Override"
msgstr "覆写"

#. type: #redstone-input
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:155
msgid ""
"When powered by redstone, override the output to the number specified in ❷."
msgstr "当被红石输入充能时，覆写输出为 ❷ 中设定的值。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:156
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hold"
msgstr "锁定值"

#. type: #redstone-input
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:158
msgid "When powered by redstone, hold the output at its current value."
msgstr "当被红石输入充能时，维持最后的输出值不变。"

#. type: Title ===
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:160
#, no-wrap
msgid "Redstone Output"
msgstr "红石输出"

#. type: #redstone-output
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:163
msgid ""
"When connected by redstone as a source, the arithmetic tube can be "
"configured to compare the numerical result with a constant, and output a "
"redstone signal when the comparison is satisfied."
msgstr "做为红石连接的源头时，算术管可以被配置将算术结果与一个常数进行比较，并在比较条件满足时输出红石信号。"

#. type: Block title
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:164
#, no-wrap
msgid "Settings with an outgoing redstone connection"
msgstr "具有红石输出连接的设置"

#. type: #redstone-output
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:167
msgid ""
"Scroll on ❶ to select a comparator (>, <, =, ≥, ≤, ≠), click ❷ to enter the "
"number to compare to."
msgstr "在 ❶ 上滚动以选择比较条件（>、<、=、≥、≤、≠），点击 ❷ 输入与结果比较的数字。"
